Fixture MKVs for the post-rip audio gate (silent_staged, ADR 0019).

Regenerate with:

    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc=duration=1:size=160x120:rate=10 \
        -c:v mpeg4 -q:v 31 silent.mkv -y
    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc=duration=1:size=160x120:rate=10 \
        -f lavfi -i anullsrc=duration=1:sample_rate=8000 \
        -c:v mpeg4 -q:v 31 -c:a aac -shortest withaudio.mkv -y

silent.mkv: video only, ~1s (~3 KB). withaudio.mkv: same + one silent AAC track.

dansub.mkv: silent.mkv plus one dan SRT subtitle track (for the subtitle
shortfall probe, subtitle_shortfall). Regenerate with:

    mkvmerge -o dansub.mkv silent.mkv --language 0:dan sub.srt

where sub.srt is a one-cue SRT, e.g.:

    1
    00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,500
    hi

silent.mkv (video only) doubles as the no-subtitle-track fixture.
